-- Module 1 — Tasks + Notifications infrastructure + generic Reminders engine.
--
-- ADDITIVE ONLY. Creates four new tables; touches no existing table beyond
-- adding indexes on its own new tables. Idempotent (IF NOT EXISTS /
-- CREATE OR REPLACE) — safe to re-run. No data is deleted or migrated.
--
